{"title":"Cozy Cocktails Social and Paint Night - National Social","startsAt":"2026-10-03T19:00:00-04:00","endsAt":"2026-10-03T22:00:00-04:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"A friendship social — not a dating event. Most guests come solo.\n✨ **[Get My Ticket →](https://nationalsocialnetworking.com/tickets?city=toronto)**\n[https://nationalsocialnetworking.com/tickets?city=toronto](https://nationalsocialnetworking.com/tickets?city=toronto)\n\nOur hosts run the room. They'll introduce you and fold you into a group — no standing on the edge with a drink.\n\n💬 Hosted mingling\n🎭 Come alone — most people do\n👕 Smart casual\n🍹 Please order one item from the venue\n\n📅 **[All Toronto Events](https://nationalsocialnetworking.com/tickets?city=toronto)**\n\n*Gratuity may be added automatically by some venues.*","venue":{"name":"Celtic Irish Pub","address":"1954 Yonge St unit# 1, Toronto, ON","lat":43.699284,"lng":-79.397,"city":"Toronto, ON"},"fee":null,"group":"National Social Networking Group - Toronto (20s-30s)","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/9/3/f/e/highres_535717886.jpeg"}